.TH "dleyna-server-service" "1" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dleyna-server-service \- Accessing DLNA media servers on the network
.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
.
.\" dleyna-server-service(1):
.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
\fBdleyna\-server\-service\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Users or administrators should never need to start this daemon as it will
be automatically started by dbus\-daemon whenever a process sends a D\-Bus message
to the \fIcom.intel.dleyna\-server\fP name on the session bus.
.sp
\fIdleyna\-server\-service\fP can discover and be used for control of DLNA media server
devices on the local network.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
This command does not have any commandline options
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fIG_MESSAGES_DEBUG\fP
Enable additional debug messages from the used libraries. Either \fIall\fP for all
debug messages or a pattern for matching a subset of messages. The available
message categories heavily depend on the library.
.TP
.B \fIGUPNP_DEBUG\fP
If set, GUPnP will print the content of SOAP calls
.TP
.B \fIDLEYNA_CONNECTOR_PATH\fP
Can be used to override the compile\-time search path for the IPC connector
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Please send bug reports to either the distribution bug tracker
or the upstream bug tracker at \%<https://\:gitlab\:.gnome\:.org/\:World/\:dLeyna/\:issues>
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
dleyna\-server\-service.conf(5)
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
